Carafe: accept cross-arch STATUS_IMAGE_MACHINE_TYPE_MISMATCH in map_pe_image_with_limit and keep on-demand WoW64 bootstrap PEB/TEB in permanent storage.
LGPL-2.1-or-later, as the file it changes.

